Description: Secure Over-The-Air update agent for embedded Linux
 OTAPulse provides reliable, atomic A/B partition updates with automatic
 rollback capabilities for embedded Linux devices. Features include:
 .
  - Atomic A/B dual-partition updates
  - RSA/ECDSA firmware signature verification
  - Automatic rollback on failed updates
  - Resumable downloads
  - Hardware watchdog integration
  - Fleet telemetry and crash reporting
 .
 This package contains the OTA agent binary, identity/inventory scripts,
 update modules, and systemd service files.
